        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 721, Stainless Steel Door Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nOmnia's Modern Solid Stainless Steel Door Pull comes with a brushed stainless steel finish. This contemporary door handle is available with thrubolt mounting or back to back mounting (must purchase 2 pulls). It is available in two sizes: 17-5/16 inches and 33 inches. it is a great choice for modern homes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available <a href=\"/products/modern-round-stainless-steel-appliance-pull-omnia-ap-721\"><b>Modern Round Stainless Steel Appliance Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Modern Stainless Steel Door Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Brushed Stainless Steel</b></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 2 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>721/400:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 17-5/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Hole Spacing: 15-3/4\" (c.c.)</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-9/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Diameter: 25/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Base Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>721/800:</b> \r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 33\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Hole Spacing: 31-1/2\" (c.c.)</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-9/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Diameter: 25/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Base Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Hardware:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Back-to-Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. <b>Requires 2 pulls</b>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually (1 door pull handle). If you order Back-to-Back Mounting please Order 2 Pulls.</i>\r\n</p>",
